<title>HUNGARY: Hungary to pay HUF5.28bln to TVK by June 30.</title>
<headline>Hungary to pay HUF5.28bln to TVK by June 30.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's privatisation agency APV Rt will pay 4.40 billion forints ($23.7 million) of privatisation revenue and an additional 842 million of accumulated interest to chemicals firm TVK by June 30, TVK said on Friday.</p>
<p>TVK said it signed an agreement with APV on Thursday about the schedule of the privatisation payout, which comes under a 1989 law.</p>
<p>Expectations in the stock exchange about the transfer to TVK and a boost to first half profits bolstered its shares in recent days.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040 ($ = 186.0 Hungarian Forints)</p>
